   --volume=/dev/disk/:/dev/disk:ro \\\\\\n    --publish=8080:8080 \\\\\\n    --detach=true \\\\\\n    --name=cadvisor\\\\\\n    gcr.io/cadvisor/cadvisor:latest\\n\\n~$ docker ps -a\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-13\",{\"children\":\"9. Install dan Konfigurasi Prometheus dengan SSL\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-9\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Untuk langkah - langkah Installasi Prometheus bisa mengikuti dari postingan saya yang  \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://vianaja.github.io/blog-najwan/2024-11-01-prometheus/\",\"children\":\"Prometheus\"}]}]}],\". Dan dilanjutkan dengan konfigurasi di bwah ini untuk menambahkan TLS ke Prometheusnya.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Buat file \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“web-config.yml”\"}]}],\" di directory \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"“/etc/prometheus/”\"}]}],\"  yang nantinya digunakan untuk koneksi ssl.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"yaml\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-yaml\",\"children\":\"tls_server_config:\\n  cert_file: /path/to/prometheus_ca.crt\\n  key_file: /path/to/prometheus_ca.key\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Lalu edit di bagian Service, di bagian \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"ExecStart\"}]}],\". terus tambahkan untuk path dari file config untuk TLS/SSL dengan \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"\\\"--web.config.file\\\"\"}]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-bash\",\"children\":\"~$ sudo nano /etc/systemd/system/prometheus_server.service\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-1\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"bash\"}],\"$L62\"]}],\"$L63\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L64\",\"\\n\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-14\",{\"children\":\"10. Install Grafana\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Bisa ikuti panduan Dibahwah ini mencakup langkah-langkah Installasi, konfigurasi Grafana hingga cara menambahkan Data Source, baik yang menggunakan HTTPS atau HTTP biasa. sehingga Anda dapat dengan mudah memahami dan mengimplementasikannya. Kunjungi Postingan saya yang ini \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://vianaja.github.io/blog-najwan/2024-10-30-grafana/\",\"children\":\"Grafana\"}],\".\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-15\",{\"children\":\"11. Install Alert Manager\"}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Untuk langkah - langkah Installasi Alert Manager bisa mengikuti dari Postingan saya yang ini. \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://vianaja.github.io/blog-najwan/2024-11-02-alert-manager/\",\"children\":\"Alert Manager\"}],\". Sudah mencakup penjelasan juga agar lebih memahami terkait Alert Manager, lalu untuk Project yang saya buat, perlu ada konfigurasi tambahan lagi, mengikuti instruksi di bawah ini.\"]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-10\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Konfigurasi untuk Alert Managernya untuk mengirim notifikasi ke mana, sebagai contoh di sini saya menggunakan 3, yaitu ke Email, Discord Webhook dan Endpoint Webhook URL (yang nantinya saya hubungkan ke Program Python yang akan memfilter Notification yang di kirim).\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"yaml\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-yaml\",\"children\":\"global:\\n  resolve_timeout: 15s\\n\\nroute:\\n  receiver: discord-all\\n  routes:\\n  - receiver: discord-python\\n    continue: true\\n  - receiver: email\\n\\nreceivers:\\n# Integrasi ke Email\\n- name: email\\n  email_configs:\\n  - to: \\\"email@test.id\\\"\\n    from: \\\"email@test.id\\\"\\n    smarthost: smtp.gmail.com:587\\n    auth_username: \\\"email@test.id\\\"\\n    auth_identity: \\\"email@test.id\\\"\\n    auth_password: \\\"TOKEN_EMAIL\\\"\\n    send_resolved: True\\n\\n# Integrasi ke Webhook Discord\\n- name: discord-all\\n  discord_configs:\\n  - webhook_url: 'URL_WEBHOOKS_DISCORD'\\n\\n# Integrasi ke Program Python\\n- name: discord-python\\n  webhook_configs:\\n  - url: \\\"URL_ENDPOINT_PYTHON\\\"\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Konfigurasi untuk rules yang mentrigger alert manager mengirim notifikasi. Lalu Edit pada bagian \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"{PERLU_UBAH}\"}]}],\" menjadi \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":\"{{ $value }}\"}]}],\".\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":\"Rules untuk Web Server Apache atau Nginx yang Down.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"pre-0\",{\"className\":\"rounded-xl overflow-x-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/10 my-6 w-full shadow-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-outline-variant/10 min-w-max\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-label text-[0.6875rem] text-outline uppercase tracking-widest\",\"children\":\"yaml\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-error/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary/40\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary/40\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"p-6 text-sm font-mono text-primary-fixed/80 leading-relaxed w-full min-w-max whitespace-pre\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"language-yaml\",\"children\":\"groups:\\n- name: nginx.rules\\n  rules:\\n  - alert: nginxDown\\n    expr: nginx_up == 0\\n    for: 1m\\n    annotations:\\n      summary: \\\"Service Nginx Down\\\"\\n      description: \\\"Service Nginx been down, sudah 1 menit, silahkan di cek dulu.\\\"\\n  \\n- name: apache.rules\\n  rules:\\n  - alert: apacheDown\\n    expr: apache_up == 0\\n    for: 1m\\n    annotations:\\n      summary: \\\"Service Apache Down\\\"\\n      description: \\\"Service Apache been down, sudah 1 menit, silahkan di cek dulu.\\\"\\n\"}]}]]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L65\",\"\\n\",\"$L66\",\"\\n\",\"$L67\",\"\\n\",\"$L68\",\"\\n\",\"$L69\",\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"h4\",\"h4-16\",{\"children\":\"12. Menambahkan Program Python, agar filter Notifikasi ke Discord\"}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-11\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Ambil Token Discord agar program python nya dapat mengirim notifikasi ke channe Discorrd yang sesuai, dari referensi video \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://youtu.be/UYJDKSah-Ww?si=2SYaHg74DT47RuGS\",\"children\":\"YouTube\"}]}]}],\" ini (cukup sampai pengambilan Token Discord).\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-on-surface/80 font-body text-lg leading-[1.6] my-4\",\"children\":[\"Donwload contoh sample program python di github \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-white font-bold\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",\"em-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://github.com/vianAja/Discord-alertmanager-python.git\",\"children\":\"ini\"}]}]}],\". untuk contoh filtering alert agar